,"O SAPL desta Câmara não registra nenhum veto desde 1º/1/2025: como não dá para saber se não houve veto ou se ele não foi cadastrado, o perfil do prefeito não mostra o número de vetos."],"notas_en":["Each councilor's office spending is not included on this site: the City Council's open data system (SAPL) does not have it.","Some laws are missing from this City Council's SAPL system (about 14 of the 86 law numbers since January 1, 2025 are not there, counting those that should have come after the last one recorded, from August 3, 2026), so the number of laws signed is left out of the mayor's profile.","This City Council's SAPL system records no veto since January 1, 2025. Since there is no way to tell whether there was no veto or it was not recorded, the mayor's profile does not show the number of vetoes."],"conferido":"2026-10-29"}},"atualizado":"2026-10-29","onde":{"camara":{"site":"https://www.barauna.pb.leg.br/","sistema":"sapl","api":"https://sapl.barauna.pb.leg.br/api/","propostas":"https://sapl.barauna.pb.leg.br/materia/pesquisar-materia","propostasOnline":true,"sic":"https://www.barauna.pb.leg.br/transparencia/controle-e-fiscalizacao-do-executivo/relatorio-estatistico-e-sic","conferido":"2026-10-23","motivo":null,"motivo_en":null},"prefeitura":{"site":"https://www.barauna.pb.gov.br/","transparencia":"https://www.barauna.pb.gov.br/transparencia","sic":"https://doc3.inf.br/pmb2501534/esic","diarioOficial":null,"conferido":"2026-10-23"}}}
